# Keep secrets and local state out of the build context (S1 / P0-IMG-01).
# Every Dockerfile here used COPY . . with no .dockerignore, so .env — which now holds
# freshly rotated secrets — and the whole .git history were baked into distributable
# image layers. `docker history` exposes them even if a later layer deletes the file.

.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

.git
.gitignore
.github
.gitlab-ci.yml

Dockerfile
docker-compose*.yml
.dockerignore

*.md
docs/

bin/
# …except the contracts fetcher, which the Dockerfile runs. `bin/` is ignored here because .NET puts
# build output there; excluding the one script it also holds made the image build die with
# "cannot open bin/sync-contracts: No such file".
!bin/sync-contracts
obj/
*.user
tests/
